# KilimoOrbit mobile — environment configuration
# Base URL of the Sentinel server. Leave it unset: the app finds the server by
# itself (the computer Expo runs on, port 4517; localhost in the browser;
# 10.0.2.2 on the Android emulator), and a phone can always be pointed at
# another address from the app's Connection screen. Set it only for a
# deployed server, then restart Expo with `npx expo start -c`.
# - Deployed (e.g. Render):   EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE=https://your-sentinel.onrender.com
# - A fixed laptop address:   EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE=http://192.168.x.x:4517
#EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE=
